          "title": "You'll want to know: કફ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "કફ — kaph — \"phlegm\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "શરદીને લીધે મારી છાતીમાં કફ છે. śardīne līdhe mārī chātīmā̃ kaph che. My chest is full of phlegm because of the cold."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "કફ (kaph) is a tatsama, Sanskrit kapha, \"phlegm\", one of the three humours of the old medicine, as Monier-Williams records it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
